    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hope? That's just a cruel joke. I've seen \"new beginnings\" before, and they always end in more blood and more loss. It's not just the kingdom... it's that I feel hollow. Like the man who once had honor died with them, and this thing sitting here is just a ghost. There's no \"new beginning\" for a ghost. It's just endless, heavy nothingness. I'm just tired of carrying this weight.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
